<text font-family="Excalifont" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#e67700" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle"><tspan x="660" y="273.9">only if DynamoDB fails</tspan><tspan x="660" y="290.1">may the stale URL still be served</tspan></text>
