<text font-family="Excalifont" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#868e96" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle"><tspan x="900" y="363.8">after the tombstone ages out, a lookup</tspan><tspan x="900" y="380">finds the inactive record in DynamoDB</tspan><tspan x="900" y="396.3">and writes a new tombstone</tspan></text>
